n background\n-\tcargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml &\n-\t@SERVER_PID=$$!; \\\n+\t./target/debug/hyperspot-server --config $(QUICKSTART_CONFIG) & \\","path":"Makefile","commit_id":"a075606a1174a8f967dabdbefe206f5c21343ea7","original_commit_id":"a075606a1174a8f967dabdbefe206f5c21343ea7","user":{"login":"graphite-app[bot]","id":96075541,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOBbn_FQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/158384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/graphite-app","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphite-app%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Critical: Windows compatibility issue in openapi target**\n\nThe command `./target/debug/hyperspot-server` will fail on Windows because:\n1. Windows executables have `.exe` extension\n2. The path separator should be handled differently\n\nThe binary will actually be at `./target/debug/hyperspot-server.exe` on Windows. This makes the entire `openapi` target non-functional on Windows, which directly contradicts the PR's goal of adding Windows support.\n\n**Fix:**\n```makefile\nifeq ($(OS),Windows_NT)\n    HYPERSPOT_SERVER_BIN := ./target/debug/hyperspot-server.exe\nelse\n    HYPERSPOT_SERVER_BIN := ./target/debug/hyperspot-server\nendif\n\nopenapi:\n\t...\n\t$(HYPERSPOT_SERVER_BIN) --config $(QUICKSTART_CONFIG) & \\\n```\n\n*Spotted by [Graphite Agent](https://app.graphite.com/diamond/?org=cyberfabric&ref=ai-review-comment)*<i class='graphite__hidden'><br /><br /><a href=\"https://app.graphite.com/github/pr/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/519?chatWithGeneratedComment=aec46ce7-e756-4e66-a889-df0f6216cf9f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Fix in Graphite\" src=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-dark.svg\"></picture></a></i><i class='graphite__hidden'><br /><br />Is this helpful? React 👍 or 👎 to let us know.</i>","created_at":"2026-02-10T06:32:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T06:32:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/519#discussion_r2786063836","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/519","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2786063836"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/519#discussion_r2786063836"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/519"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2786063836/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":270,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":35,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2789809599","pull_request_