"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T00:55:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T00:55:49Z","body":"@hitengajjar , my review summary:\r\n\r\n```\r\n1. Scope Boundaries (What Doesn't Belong Here)\r\n- Remove 5 ADRs that are global platform decisions, not module-specific\r\n- Remove ~15 NFRs that are platform-level, not module requirements\r\n- Security concerns (TLS, DDoS, encryption) belong at API gateway/platform level\r\n- Don't store credentials - that's credential store's responsibility\r\n\r\n2. GTS Type System Issues\r\n- Fix GTS ID format (wrong vendor, wrong pattern)\r\n- Implement GTS-scoped access control throughout\r\n- CRITICAL: Validate GTS access claims to prevent impersonation\r\n- Use GTS schemas for trait definitions\r\n- Base type naming is incorrect\r\n\r\n3. Architecture & Dependencies\r\n- Reclassify actors vs dependencies (several modules aren't real actors)\r\n- Add missing actor types (integrations, custom modules, workflows)\r\n- Add GTS access manager component\r\n- Missing fields in domain model (is_locked)\r\n\r\n4. Domain Model Simplification\r\n- Add Resource as third domain type alongside Tenant/User\r\n- Simplify domain object handling (always use UUID)\r\n- Simplify validation approach (per-tenant scoping)\r\n\r\n5. Tenant Hierarchy Concerns\r\n- Verify approach with @aviator5 (appears in 2 ADRs)\r\n- Materialized path has fundamental issues (depth limits, tenant moves)\r\n- Consider alternative approaches (closure table)\r\n- Remove artificial hierarchy depth limit\r\n\r\n6. Documentation Quality\r\n- Update to CyberFabric branding\r\n- Remove obsolete markers\r\n- Add implementation priorities\r\n- Use new ADR template with proper options/tradeoffs\r\n\r\n7. Missing Clarifications\r\n- What is \"SUBROOT\"?\r\n- Need two strategies for default value resolution\r\n- Verify if certain areas need separate GTS access checks\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3868739076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3870285293","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/477#issuecomment-3870285293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/477","id":3870285293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7mr93t","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T08:59:17Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T08:59:17Z","body":"There are unresolved review comments awaiting response.\n\nUnanswered human review threads: 75\nUnresolved comments: 89","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR