d line 40-49: The \"Related Design Elements\" section's markdown lists are\nnot surrounded by blank lines (MD032); update the ADR file by adding a blank\nline before the \"**Principles**:\" list and another blank line after the last\nlist item (after `fdd-settings-service-fr-gts-extension-point`) so both the\n\"Principles\" and \"Requirements\" lists are each separated from surrounding\nparagraphs/headers. Locate the \"Related Design Elements\" header and the list\nblocks in the ADR (look for the \"**Principles**:\" and \"**Requirements**:\"\nlabels) and insert the required blank lines to satisfy the linter.\n\nIn\n`@modules/system/settings_service/docs/adrs/0002-fdd-settings-service-adr-database-technology.md`:\n- Around line 41-48: In the \"Related Design Elements\" section (header \"##\nRelated Design Elements\") add blank lines before and after each bulleted list so\nthe Markdown linter MD032 is satisfied; specifically ensure there is a blank\nline between the \"## Related Design Elements\" heading and the \"**Principles**:\"\nlist, a blank line after the Principles list, a blank line before the\n\"**Requirements**:\" list, and a blank line after the Requirements list (these\nlists contain the items\n`fdd-settings-service-constraint-database-compatibility`,\n`fdd-settings-service-fr-setting-value-crud`, and\n`fdd-settings-service-fr-tenant-inheritance`).\n\nIn\n`@modules/system/settings_service/docs/adrs/0003-fdd-settings-service-adr-caching-strategy.md`:\n- Around line 42-50: The unordered sub-list items under the settings entries\n`cache_tenant_hierarchy_depth` and `cache_sliding_window_size` use inconsistent\nhyphen markers causing markdownlint MD004; update those sub-list markers to\nasterisks so they match the document's list style (replace each leading \"-\" on\nthe indented lines describing the points and examples for\n`cache_tenant_hierarchy_depth` and `cache_sliding_window_size` with \"*\").\n\nIn\n`@modules/system/settings_service/docs/adrs/0009-fdd-se