cestor of the changed setting),\nboundary (propagation stops at that subroot and does not continue to global/root\nor unrelated branches), and a short example (e.g., changing a setting under\nproject A triggers events to the project-level subroot but not to the\norganization root or sibling projects) so implementers can unambiguously\nimplement SUBROOT handling in the setting type event trait configuration.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/477#pullrequestreview-3771324769","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/477","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/477#pullrequestreview-3771324769"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/477"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-09T05:52:35Z","commit_id":"eca3ef46ec98b7afacc6b73388abe9efbee3eb23"}]},{"source_pr_number":402,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/402","source_state":"open","source_author":"akshatjhalani","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #402] [WIP] feat(web-search-gateway): add PRD and Design for Web Search Gateway","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feature/web-search-gateway","pr_head_sha":"8af9588dc0a4b2752bc18bbd5b54df0d630b8b23","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"akshatjhalani","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/402","id":3235288695,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7A1pZ3","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/402","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/402.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/402.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issu