stgres://settings_user:${SETTINGS_DB_PASSWORD}@postgres:5432/settings_db?application_name=hyperspot-settings\"\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n  simple-user-settings:\n    # Module-specific database configuration\n    database:\n      server: \"postgres_base\"\n      \n      # Module-specific DSN overrides user, password, and database name\n      dsn: \"postgres://settings_user:${SETTINGS_DB_PASSWORD}@postgres:5432/settings_db?application_name=hyperspot-settings\"\n      \n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@config/e2e-local-postgres.yaml` around lines 191 - 198, The\nsimple-user-settings database DSN uses localhost which, inside the API\ncontainer, points to itself and prevents connecting to the Postgres service;\nupdate the dsn value under simple-user-settings -> database to use the Docker\nservice hostname \"postgres\" (i.e. replace \"localhost\" with \"postgres\") or remove\nthe explicit host from the DSN so it inherits the server template, ensuring the\nservice can reach the postgres container.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 6c63b51","created_at":"2026-01-27T08:15:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T08:33:13Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/320#discussion_r2730778439","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/320","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2730778439"},"html":{"href":"https://github.c