cker/docker-compose.yml | head -60\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 3268\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\necho \"=== Config file: e2e-local-postgres.yaml ===\"\necho \"Looking for DSN and database credentials...\"\ngrep -E \"(dsn|db_password|DATABASE_URL)\" config/e2e-local-postgres.yaml\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Config file: e2e-local-mysql.yaml ===\"\necho \"Looking for DSN and database credentials...\"\ngrep -E \"(dsn|db_password|DATABASE_URL)\" config/e2e-local-mysql.yaml\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Full grep for password-related settings in config files ===\"\ngrep -i \"password\\|dsn\\|database.*url\" config/e2e-local-*.yaml | head -20\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 2512\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\necho \"=== Context around lines 100-101 (USERS_INFO_DB_PASSWORD) ===\"\nsed -n '95,105p' testing/docker/docker-compose.yml | cat -n\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Context around lines 120-121 (SETTINGS_DB_PASSWORD) ===\"\nsed -n '115,125p' testing/docker/docker-compose.yml | cat -n\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Full service structure to understand credential usage ===\"\ngrep -n \"^  [a-z].*:\" testing/docker/docker-compose.yml | head -20\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 1417\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Hardcoded database credentials are acceptable for E2E tests, but review should cover all credentials.**\n\nThe credentials are hardcoded, which is appropriate for isolated E2E testing environments. Verify that all four sets of hardcoded credentials match their DSN values:\n- PostgreSQL: `hyperspot_pass` (line 34) and module credentials `users_info_pass`, `settings_pass` (lines 100-101)\n- MariaDB: `root_pass` (line 53), `hyperspot_pass` (line 56), and module credentials `users_info_pass`, `settings_pass` (lines 120-121)\n\nThese map to environment variables `${USERS_INFO_DB_PASSWORD}` and `${SETTINGS_DB_PASSWORD}` in config files `e2e-local-postgres.yaml` and `e2e-local-mysql.yaml`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@testing/docker/docker-compose.yml` around lines 32 - 35, Ensure all hardcoded\nDB credentials in docker-compose.yml are consistent with the DSNs and config\nvariables used by the test modules: verify\nPOSTGRES_USER/POSTGRES_PASSWORD/POSTGRES_DB, the MariaDB password entries (e.g.,\nroot_pass and hyperspot_pass), and the module-specific credentials\nusers_info_pass and settings_pass match the environment variables referenced as\n${USERS_INFO_DB_PASSWORD} and ${SETTINGS_DB_PASSWORD} in e2e-local-postgres.yaml\nand e2e-local-mysql.yaml; if any mismatch, update the values in\ndocker-compose.yml (POSTGRES_PASSWORD, MariaDB password envs, and\nusers_info_pass/settings_pass) to match the DSN/config variable values so the\nE2E services authenticate correctly.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-28T10:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T10:16:30Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/320#discussion_r2735918368","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/320","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2735918368"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/320#discussion_r2735918368"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/320"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2735918368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":38,"original_start_line":32,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":41,"original_line":35,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":35,"position":41,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyb