generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced an in-house token watcher for OAuth2 client-credentials lifecycle management, featuring lock-free cached token reads, background refresh scheduling with jitter, and exponential backoff.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Removed external token lifecycle dependency, consolidating token refresh logic into a dedicated internal module for improved reliability and control.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated architecture decision records, design documentation, and security policies to reflect the new token management approach and FIPS posture.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1970?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-26T23:45:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T06:16:41Z","closed_at":"2026-05-28T06:16:41Z","merged_at":"2026-05-28T06:16:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"4b7955d811b167c4e70936aa585786cf17dca24d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1970/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1970/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1970/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/a2b0db4b766335cacddd057f05898ce821231eba","head":{"label":"mattgarmon:token_watcher","ref":"token_watcher","sha":"a2b0db4b766335cacddd057f05898ce821231eb