dated_at":"2026-05-26T10:58:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3303271197","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3303271197"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3303271197"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3303271197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":95,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3292596391,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640158","pull_request_review_id":4364771970,"id":3304640158,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs7E-M6e","diff_hunk":"@@ -187,11 +196,13 @@ modules:\n \n   static-mini-chat-audit-plugin:\n     config:\n+      vendor: \"cyberfabric\"","path":"config/mini-chat.yaml","commit_id":"ec30128e0ea8f1062dfe6acb98f96abcdaedc29f","original_commit_id":"a503b2aeadc43a819d73c65465480af40dcaa3a1","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**HIGH**\n\nThe Helm equivalent of this block in `modules/mini-chat/deploy/helm/mini-chat/templates/configmap.yaml` was not updated and still uses a different typo: `vendor: \"cybeware\"` (no 'r') on lines 79, 83, 87, 96, 101, 169.\n\nBecause the resolver/plugin defaults are now `cyberfabric`, deployed Helm pods would fail to match the static authn/authz/tr/model-policy plugins — the same class of bug this PR is fixing.\n\nReplace all six `vendor: \"cybeware\"` occurrences in `templates/configmap.yaml` with `vendor: \"cyberfabric\"` so the Helm chart matches the YAML configs updated in this PR.","created_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640158","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640158"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640158"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":199,"original_line":199,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":70,"position":70,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640170","pull_request_review_id":4364771970,"id":3304640170,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs7E-M6q","diff_hunk":"@@ -187,11 +196,13 @@ modules:\n \n   static-mini-chat-audit-plugin:\n     config:\n+      vendor: \"cyberfabric\"","path":"config/mini-chat.yaml","commit_id":"ec30128e0ea8f1062dfe6acb98f96abcdaedc29f","original_commit_id":"a503b2aeadc43a819d73c65465480af40dcaa3a1","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**LOW**\n\nRelated typo: `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry-sdk/Cargo.toml:11` has `keywords = [\"cybeware\", \"cyberware\", \"cyberfabric-system\"]` — `\"cybeware\"` is a typo of `\"cyberware\"`.\n\nNot a runtime concern (crates.io keyword only), but it slipped through the same way the Helm vendor typo did.\n\nReplace `\"cybeware\"` with `\"cyberware\"` in the keywords array.","created_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640170","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640170"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640170"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":199,"original_line":199,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":70,"position":70,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640178","pull_request_review_id":4364771970,"id":3304640178,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs7E-M6y","diff_hunk":"@@ -61,11 +62,7 @@ impl Module for SingleTenantTrPlugin {\n                 api,\n             );\n \n-        info!(\n-            instance_id = %instance_id,\n-            vendor = VENDOR,\n-            priority = PRIORITY\n-        );\n+        info!(instance_id = %instance_id);","path":"modules/system/tenant-resolver/plugins/single-tenant-tr-plugin/src/module.rs","commit_id":"a503b2aeadc43a819d73c65465480af40dcaa3a1","original_commit_id":"a503b2aeadc43a819d73c65465480af40dcaa3a1","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**LOW**\n\nThe final `info!(instance_id = %instance_id)` log drops the `vendor` and `priority` fields that the previous version logged here.\n\nThe earlier `info!` at the top of `init` already logs them, but separating instance_id from the vendor/priority pair makes log correlation harder when grepping for a specific instance.\n\nInclude `vendor` and `priority` in this log line as well: `info!(instance_id = %instance_id, vendor = %cfg.vendor, priority = cfg.priority, \"registered\");`.","created_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T14:50:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640178","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640178"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1965#discussion_r3304640178"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1965"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3304640178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":65,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":48,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/3310028249","pull_request_review