_ref":"cyberware","pr_head_sha":"c633b0f3f3125270fcb0d4a3dc9a00c5ca2040eb","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"Artifizer","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1963","id":3726831022,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7eIu2u","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1963","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1963.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1963.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1963","number":1963,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(guidelines): add GTS PR review guide and wire into review configs","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Add `guidelines/GTS.md`: comprehensive GTS PR review guide covering identifier format, type schema and instance definition rules, Rust typed ID fields (`GtsTypeId`/`GtsInstanceId` vs `String`), instance construction via `gts_make_instance_id`, `try_narrow` heterogeneous dispatch, traits, ABAC/security, design guidelines, Cyber Ware conventions (15 items), and a quick review checklist Incorporates recent upstream changes: Draft-07 adoption (explicit forbidden keyword list), `type_id` terminology (`schema_id` deprecated), `GTS Registry` rename, schema-only keyword enforcement in instances, `is_type_schema` vs `is_type` distinction, and macro `description` emission fix\r\n\r\n- Wire `guidelines/GTS.md` as `gts_guidelines` in Cypilot Code Review and Design Review prompt configs (`.cypilot/config/pr-review.toml` and the kit-level equivalent)\r\n\r\n- Add GTS trigger conditions to `docs/checklists/CODING.md` (2 items) and `docs/checklists/DESIGN.md` (4 items: domain model, API contracts, extensibility, authorization)\r\n\r\n- Add GTS reference line to `docs/pr-review/modkit-rust-review.md`; fix trailing whitespace in example output block\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added comprehensive Global Type System (GTS) guidelines covering conventions for defining and reviewing types and instances.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Enhanced code review and design review processes with GTS-related validation checks.\n  * Updated development checklists to include GTS review requirements.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1963?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-21T23:13:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T23:28:20Z","closed_at":"2026-05-26T23:28:20Z","merged_at":"2026-05-26T23:28:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"e2e95b6a03cb7e1a8573fc7d168d5a7e22b9f72a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"aviator5","id":245955115,"node_id":"U_kgDODqj6Kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.