e decision records: added intermediate entries, adjusted dates, and renumbered cross-references to reflect the chosen \"Thin Host Module, Fat Runtime Plugins\" path (ADR-5) and subsequent ADRs.\n  * Added a comprehensive Serverless Runtime host decomposition guide outlining MVP vs deferred features, dependencies, and component responsibilities.\n  * Added Module Scaffold documentation with acceptance criteria, smoke tests, and completion standards.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1958?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-20T11:01:33Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T21:05:01Z","closed_at":"2026-05-21T21:05:01Z","merged_at":"2026-05-21T21:05:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"2a6832b4cf96062a044e5cb7b31ef3eb183a03a0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1958/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1958/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1958/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/07c1e5abfdb86b57f8193b8dd6fe76390529dea2","head":{"label":"AntonBraer:docs/serverless-runtime-decomposition","ref":"docs/serverless-runtime-decomposition","sha":"07c1e5abfdb86b57f8193b8dd6fe76390529dea2","user":{"login":"AntonBraer","id":94956080,"node_id":"U_kgDOBajqMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94956080?v=4","gravatar_id":"