etails>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between ba2c51d581815a64e16c22fc1c4e18f7dbd85f21 and 07c1e5abfdb86b57f8193b8dd6fe76390529dea2.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (3)</summary>\n\n* `modules/serverless-runtime/docs/NEXT_ADR_SCOPE.md`\n* `modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/DECOMPOSITION.md`\n* `modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/features/module-scaffold.md`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Files skipped from review due to trivial changes (2)</summary>\n\n* modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/features/module-scaffold.md\n* modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/DECOMPOSITION.md\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nAdds and refines Serverless Runtime host documentation: updates ADR numbering, introduces a host decomposition and feature dependency framework, and specifies the Module Scaffold feature with definitions of done and acceptance criteria.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Serverless Runtime Host Architecture & Feature Documentation**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**ADR Scope Renumbering** <br> `modules/serverless-runtime/docs/NEXT_ADR_SCOPE.md`|Updated metadata and ADR numbering to reflect \"Thin Host Module, Fat Runtime Plugins\" as completed ADR-5. Subsequent planned ADRs (Runtime Capabilities SDK through Error Taxonomy) renumbered to ADR-6 through ADR-11 with cross-references updated.|\n|**Host Crate Decomposition & Feature Framework** <br> `modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/DECOMPOSITION.md`|New document defining the three-crate boundary, MVP vs deferred timing, eight host features (module scaffold, function registry, REST surface, plugin dispatcher + invocation index, JSON-RPC transport, MCP server, tenant policy management, audit aggregation + error mapping), and explicit feature dependency graph with critical-path MVP rationale.|\n|**Module Scaffold Feature Specification** <br> `modules/serverless-runtime/serverless-runtime/docs/features/module-scaffold.md`|New document specifying the first host feature, including purpose (bootstrap host as ModKit module), CDSL process flows, definitions of done covering workspace wiring, module declaration, layer skeleton directories, DomainError stub, integration registration, and smoke tests, plus acceptance criteria and non-functional constraints to keep the scaffold minimal.|\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~10 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 A fearless rabbit hops through the docs today,  \n> ADRs numbered, features mapped the organized way,  \n> From thin host to fat plugins, the vision takes flight—  \n> With scaffold specs polished, the foundation is right!  \n> ✨ Build it, test it, let the Serverless Runtime bloom! 🌟\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/4497674166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96