tomatically reviews every GitHub pull request, identifies logic bugs, edge cases, security issues, and code quality problems, and provides actionable suggestions your team can apply immediately.\r\n\r\nInstall in minutes. Integrates seamlessly into your existing workflows.\r\n\r\n## Qodo is designed for developers who:\r\n- Handle frequent pull requests and need reliable review coverage\r\n- Balance code quality with fast delivery\r\n- Work in complex, multi-repo systems\r\n- Use AI-generated code and need stronger guardrails\r\n- Build production software where reliability matters\r\n\r\n## Qodo Capabilities\r\n- ## Automated PR Analysis\r\n  - Reviews every pull request automatically\r\n  - No manual trigger required\r\n\r\n- ## Context-Aware Code Review\r\n  - Understands cross-file changes\r\n  - Detects architectural inconsistencies\r\n\r\n- ## Actionable Suggestions\r\n  - Concrete code fixes\r\n  - Clear explanations\r\n  - Prioritized feedback\r\n\r\n- ## Security & Reliability Checks\r\n  - Identifies risky patterns\r\n  - Reduces attack surface area","external_url":"https://www.qodo.ai/","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/qodo-code-review","created_at":"2023-11-16T16:18:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T15:53:40Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"read","contents":"write","discussions":"write","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","discussion_comment","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review_comment","push"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":1955,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1955","source_state":"closed","source_author":"maurolacy","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #1955] docs: Fix some doctests","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"docs/fix-doctests","pr_head_sha":"f12b3510e816bf7d0936f1a385eb50ed4451dc2f","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"maurolacy","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1955","id":3714927146,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7dbUoq","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1955","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1955.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1955.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1955","number":1955,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs: Fix some doctests","user":{"login":"maurolacy","id":11656534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU2NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11656534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy","html_url":"https://github.com/maurolacy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurolacy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Some doctest fixes.\r\n\r\n1. 9 broken `no_run` examples in `modkit-http/client.rs` that were failing compilation (API drift + missing boilerplate).\r\n2. Fix 3 broken files in `usage-collector-sdk` with stale `BaseModkitPluginV1` rename, private field access, and `schema_id` mismatch.\r\n3. Add `url` dev-dependency to `modkit-http` for the URL construction doctest.\r\n\r\nThere are a bunch of doctests marked as `ignore` btw. Are you OK with me enabling and fixing those as well? Or will that introduce extra maintenance burden?\r\nAsking first, in any case. Thanks!\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated HTTP client examples to match current async usage and improve runnable snippets.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Simplified resource-type initialization and adjusted plugin schema configuration.\n\n* **Chore**\n  * Added a development dependency to the workspace manifest.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1955?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-20T08:17:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T15:13:34Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T10:44:26Z","merged_at":"2026-05-23T10:44:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"14d74cce9af94a1c042dc25b16191be16889bcca","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1955/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1955/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1955/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/f12b3510e816bf7d0936f1a385eb50ed4451dc2f","head":{"label":"maurolacy:docs/fix-doctests","ref":"docs/fix-doctests","sha":"f12b3510e816bf7d0936f1a385eb50ed4451dc2f","user":{"login":"maurolacy","id":11656534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU2NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11656534?v=4","gravatar_id