ails>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 2ddf87ed7bab8220547d632538479a8c18afd3cb and cf829f32b9648e1e1af02eabd84cf4f9f7297b2a.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (1)</summary>\n\n* `libs/rustls-corecrypto-provider/src/oe.rs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Files skipped from review due to trivial changes (1)</summary>\n\n* libs/rustls-corecrypto-provider/src/oe.rs\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThe PR adds macOS major version `26` to the `SUPPORTED_OE_MACOS_MAJOR` allowlist in the rustls CoreCrypto provider, updating the constant from `&[12, 13, 14, 15]` to `&[12, 13, 14, 15, 26]`.\n\n## Changes\n\n**macOS OE version support**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Extend macOS major-version allowlist** <br> `libs/rustls-corecrypto-provider/src/oe.rs`|`SUPPORTED_OE_MACOS_MAJOR` constant expanded to include macOS major version 26 in the runtime operating environment validation list.|\n\n🎯 1 (Trivial) | ⏱️ ~2 minutes\n\n> 🐰 One line extends our reach,  \n> To Sequoia's sandy beach!  \n> Version twenty-six now shines,  \n> In FIPS witness lines. 🍎✨  \n> Hop, patch, and ship — small wins.\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"u