rfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1946.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1946.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1946","number":1946,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"refactor!: remove modkit-errors crate, migrate to modkit-canonical-errors","user":{"login":"asmith987","id":260502008,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4bx-A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260502008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987","html_url":"https://github.com/asmith987","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmith987/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Delete libs/modkit-errors and libs/modkit-errors-macro\r\n- Remove legacy Problem/ValidationError/ApiResult/trace_layer re-exports from libs/modkit; api_dto and operation_builder now route through modkit-canonical-errors\r\n- Migrate module-orchestrator handlers from legacy prelude to canonical_prelude\r\n- Migrate users-info-sdk to alias CanonicalError as UsersInfoError; add gts.rs with resource-type constants\r\n- Drop redundant From<DomainError> for UsersInfoError; canonical mapping in users-info/src/api/rest/error.rs is now the single boundary\r\n- Fix two broken doc links in docs/arch/errors/DESIGN.md\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRab