4358fe98622b3ac48c.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (13)</summary>\n\n* `examples/modkit/users-info/users-info/src/domain/service/mod.rs`\n* `modules/mini-chat/mini-chat/src/domain/service/mod.rs`\n* `modules/mini-chat/mini-chat/src/gts/permissions.rs`\n* `modules/simple-user-settings/simple-user-settings/src/domain/service.rs`\n* `modules/system/account-management/account-management/src/domain/tenant/service/mod.rs`\n* `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/lib.rs`\n* `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer.rs`\n* `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer_tests.rs`\n* `modules/system/oagw/oagw/src/domain/services/management.rs`\n* `modules/system/oagw/oagw/src/infra/proxy/mod.rs`\n* `modules/system/resource-group/resource-group/src/domain/group_service.rs`\n* `modules/system/resource-group/resource-group/src/domain/membership_service.rs`\n* `modules/system/resource-group/resource-group/tests/authz_integration_test.rs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Files skipped from review due to trivial changes (1)</summary>\n\n* modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/lib.rs\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚧 Files skipped from review as they are similar to previous changes (3)</summary>\n\n* modules/system/oagw/oagw/src/domain/services/management.rs\n* modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer_tests.rs\n* modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer.rs\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nResourceType’s representation is changed in the authz-resolver SDK (name -> Cow<'static, str>, constructors/accessors added, Copy removed). Call sites, module constants, and tests are updated to use `ResourceType::from_static(...)` and the new `name()` accessor; EvaluationRequest construction now materializes the Cow name.\n\n## Changes\n\n**ResourceType Cow Migration**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Core SDK ResourceType contract update** <br> `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer.rs`|ResourceType name field changed to `Cow<'static, str>`, `Copy` removed, `from_static`/`new` constructors and `name()`/`supported_properties()` accessors added; EvaluationRequest now uses `resource.name.clone().into_owned()`.|\n|**SDK documentation and test fixture updates** <br> `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/lib.rs`, `modules/system/authz-resolver/authz-resolver-sdk/src/pep/enforcer_tests.rs`|Crate docs and test fixtures updated to construct ResourceType via `ResourceType::from_static(...)` and to use accessors in assertions.|\n|**Application module resource constant migrations** <br> `examples/modkit/users-info/.../src/domain/service/mod.rs`, `modules/mini-chat/.../src/domain/service/mod.rs`, `modules/mini-chat/.../src/gts/permissions.rs`, `modules/simple-user-settings/.../src/domain/service.rs`, `modules/system/account-management/.../src/domain/tenant/service/mod.rs`, `modules/system/oagw/.../src/domain/services/management.rs`, `modules/system/oagw/.../src/infra/proxy/mod.rs`, `modules/system/resource-group/.../src/domain/group_service.rs`, `modules/system/resource-group/.../src/domain/membership_service.rs`, `modules/system/resource-group/.../tests/authz_integration_test.rs`|All module-level `ResourceType` constants replaced struct-literal initializers with `ResourceType::from_static(...)`; tests updated to call `.name()` where code previously accessed `.name` directly.|\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~25 minutes\n\n> 🐰 I hopped through code with careful paws,  \n> > Borrowed strings shaped by gentle laws,  \n> > Copy laid to rest, Cow curls near,  \n> > Resources sing, the build runs clear. 🥕\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/4478927531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/4480471672","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1945#issuecomment-4480471672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1945","id":4480471672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs8AAAABCw6SeA","user":{"login":"qodo-code-review[bot]","id":151058649,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCQD42Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/484649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/qodo-code-review","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/