ation":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":44,"position":52,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":1926,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1926","source_state":"closed","source_author":"capybutler","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #1926] feat(usage-collector): [4/6] add query API (aggregated and raw endpoints)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"usage-collector/feature-3/query-api","pr_head_sha":"e4dfab0662ec59f5023aaa68662ff424acf86a32","pr_base_ref":"usage-collector/feature-2/rest-client","pr_head_owner":"capybutler","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1926","id":3696510993,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7cVEgR","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1926","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1926.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1926.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1926","number":1926,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(usage-collector): [4/6] add query API (aggregated and raw endpoints)","user":{"login":"capybutler","id":261428887,"node_id":"U_kgDOD5UWlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261428887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler","html_url":"https://github.com/capybutler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Adds `GET /usage-collector/v1/aggregated` and `GET /usage-collector/v1/raw` REST endpoints for querying usage records by authenticated tenant\r\n- Implements PDP-backed authorization via a new `authz` domain module (`authorize_and_compile_scope`), compiling OR-of-ANDs constraints into `AccessScope` with fail-closed error\r\nhandling\r\n- Extends the SDK with query models (`AggregationQuery`, `RawQuery`, `AggregationFn`, `BucketSize`, `GroupByDimension`, `Cursor`) and new plugin API query methods; updates the noop\r\nstorage plugin accordingly\r\n- Adds cursor-based pagination for the raw endpoint (HMAC-signed, TTL-enforced opaque tokens) and input validation for time ranges, page size, and string filter lengths\r\n- Adds feature spec `0003-cpt-cf-usage-collector-feature-query-api.md` and updates `DESIGN.md` / `DECOMPOSITION.md`\r\n\r\n## PR Train\r\n| # | PR | Description | Lines |\r\n|---|---|------------|------:|\r\n| 1 | [1907](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1907) | Feature 1 (Core SDK, Emitter & In-Process Ingest): SDK + docs | ~2500 |\r\n| 2 | [1908](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1908) | Feature 1 (Core SDK, Emitter & In-Process Ingest): `usage-collector` gateway + `usage-emitter` + `noop-usage-collector-storage-plugin` | ~8000 |\r\n| 3 | [1919](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1919) | Feature 2 (REST Client & Remote Ingest Delivery) | ~2800 |\r\n| 4 | [1926 (**this**)](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1926) | Feature 3 (Query API) | ~6000 |\r\n| 5 | [1927](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1927) | Feature 4 (TimescaleDB plugin) | ~7700 |\r\n| 6 | [1835](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1835) | e2e tests | ~1500 |\r\n|   |  | ... to be 