): [1/6] add SDK crate and design documentation","user":{"login":"capybutler","id":261428887,"node_id":"U_kgDOD5UWlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261428887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler","html_url":"https://github.com/capybutler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n- Introduces `usage-collector-sdk`: trait boundaries (`UsageCollectorClientV1`,\r\n  `UsageCollectorPluginClientV1`), `UsageRecord` model, error types, and GTS\r\n  plugin registration schema — the shared contract used by all other crates in\r\n  this component\r\n- Adds the DECOMPOSITION document decomposing the DESIGN into 8 features and\r\n  the Feature 1 spec (Core SDK, Emitter & In-Process Ingest)\r\n- Updates DESIGN to reflect the finalized architecture: emitter-based two-phase\r\n  authorization (`authorize_for()` / `authorize()`), explicit in-process vs.\r\n  remote delivery modes, and corrected FR alignment throughout\r\n- Updates PRD to add REST API ingestion as a distinct FR and widen the\r\n  `usage-source` actor definition to cover remote and external sources\r\n\r\n## PR Train\r\n| # | PR | Description | Lines |\r\n|---|---|------------|------:|\r\n| 1  | [1907 (**this**)](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1907) | Feature 1 (Core SDK, Emitter & In-Process Ingest): SDK + docs | ~2500 |\r\n| 2 | [1908](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1908) | Feature 1 (Core SDK, Emitter & In-Process Ingest): `usage-collector` gateway + `usage-emitter` + `noop-usage-collector-storage-plugin` | ~8000 |\r\n| 3 | [1919](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1919) | Feature 2 (REST Client & Remote Ingest Delivery) | ~2800 |\r\n| 4 | [1926](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1926) | Feature 3 (Query API) | ~6000 |\r\n| 5 | [1927](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1927) | Feature 4 (TimescaleDB plugin) | ~7700 |\r\n| 6 | [1835](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/1835) | e2e tests | ~1500 |\r\n|  |  | ... to be continued ... | |\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Code follows project style guidelines\r\n- [x] Self-review completed\r\n- [x] No linting errors (`cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings -D clippy::perf`)\r\n- [x] Code is properly formatted (`cargo fmt`)\r\n- [x] `cpt validate` — all checks passed\r\n- [x] Tests pass (`cargo nextest run --workspace`)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n* **New Features**\r\n  * Introduced Usage Collector SDK with simplified two-phase authorization for metric emission.\r\n  * Added REST API support for metric ingestion from external sources.\r\n  * Enhanced tenant and subject attribution enforcement through PDP authorization.\r\n\r\n* **Documentation**\r\n  * Updated design specifications on authorization flow and metric source attribution mechanisms.\r\n  * Added comprehensive feature specifications and system decomposition documentation.\r\n\r\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\r\n\r\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/1907)\r\n\r\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\r\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-15T10:58:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T21:14:17Z","closed_at":"2026-05-19T21:14:17Z","merged_at":"2026-05-19T21:14:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"4e87c10fd4e67a3cd313663c7bef624be84806df","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1907/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/1907/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/1907/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/87ae287b8c2f0894dfe9431ed37496b647462fc5","head":{"label":"capybutler:usage-collector/feature-1/docs+sdk","ref":"usage-collector/feature-1/docs+sdk","sha":"87ae28